#: includes/class-settings.php:41
msgid "Disable XML-RPC"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:42
msgid "Blocks xmlrpc.php and pingbacks, a common brute-force and DDoS amplification target."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:45
msgid "Disable file editor"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:46
msgid "Removes the theme and plugin code editors from wp-admin so a stolen login cannot inject code."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:49
msgid "Hide WordPress version"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:50
msgid "Strips the version from page markup, feeds and asset URLs to slow down targeted scans."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:53
msgid "Block user enumeration"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:54
msgid "Stops visitors from listing usernames through ?author= URLs, the REST API and sitemaps."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:57
msgid "Security headers"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:58
msgid "Sends nosniff, frame, referrer and permissions headers, plus HSTS when the site runs on HTTPS."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:61
msgid "Limit login attempts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:62
msgid "Temporarily locks out an IP address after repeated failed logins."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:65
msgid "Generic login errors"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:66
msgid "Shows one neutral message on failed logins so attackers cannot tell whether a username exists."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:69
#: includes/class-two-factor.php:559
#: includes/class-two-factor.php:641
msgid "Two-factor login"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:70
msgid "Lets each user add an authenticator app code to their login from their profile page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:73
msgid "Request firewall"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:74
msgid "Scores every part of each request, from the address to form fields, JSON, cookies and uploads, for SQL, script, code and command injection, path traversal and attack tools, and blocks clear attacks. Tune it on the Firewall tab."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:77
msgid "Auto-ban repeat attackers"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:78
msgid "Bans an IP from the whole site when it keeps getting locked out or keeps tripping the firewall."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:81
msgid "Block 404 probing"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:82
msgid "Bans bots that request many missing pages in a few minutes while hunting for vulnerable files."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:85
msgid "Block breached passwords"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:86
msgid "Refuses new passwords found in public data breaches and warns administrators whose current password is breached. Uses the Have I Been Pwned range API, which never receives the password."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:90
msgid "Requires long, varied passwords for the roles you choose, and can make passwords expire. Set the rules below."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:93
msgid "Detailed audit trail"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:94
msgid "Also logs content changes, core site settings, profile, email and password changes, logouts, failed logins and privacy requests."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:97
msgid "Passkey login"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:98
msgid "Lets users add passkeys on their profile and sign in with a fingerprint, face or device PIN. Needs HTTPS."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:101
msgid "Rate limiting"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:102
msgid "Answers 429 to an IP that sends too many login, API, AJAX or search requests in a minute, and bans IPs that keep doing it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:105
msgid "Country blocking"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:106
msgid "Blocks or allows visitors by country, for the whole site or only the login page. Set the countries under Access."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:109
#: includes/views/dashboard.php:507
msgid "Login CAPTCHA"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:110
msgid "Adds a Cloudflare Turnstile or hCaptcha check to the login, lost password and registration forms. Connect one under Login page below; both are free."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:114
msgid "Shows blocked and locked-out visitors a clear page with a help assistant and a way to ask you for access, and adds sign-in help to the login page. Set it up under Visitor help."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:117
msgid "Critical file watch"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:118
msgid "Fingerprints wp-config.php, .htaccess, drop-ins, must-use plugins and key core files every hour, and alerts you the moment one changes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:121
msgid "Automatic under attack mode"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:122
msgid "When blocked requests pile up, puts a one-second browser check in front of the site until the flood stops, so bots cannot keep the server busy. Set it up on the Edge tab."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:125
msgid "Page script monitor"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:126
msgid "Lists every script your pages load and alerts you when a new or suspicious one appears, the usual sign of a card skimmer or injected ads."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:129
msgid "Exposed files and keys check"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:130
msgid "Checks every day that backups, database dumps, logs, .env and .git cannot be downloaded, and that no secret keys show in your pages."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:133
msgid "Blocklist and domain checks"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:134
msgid "Checks every day that spam blocklists, and Google Safe Browsing if you add a key, do not list your site, and warns a month before your domain expires. See the results on the Edge tab."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:137
msgid "Vulnerability alerts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:138
msgid "Checks WordPress, your plugins and your themes every day against the free WPVulnerability database, and flags plugins that were closed or abandoned. No account or key needed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:141
msgid "Threat intelligence blocklist"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:142
msgid "Blocks networks run by criminals and spammers, using the free Spamhaus DROP list, refreshed daily. Can also block Tor exit nodes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:146
msgid "Shows who is on the site right now: logins, blocked requests, missing pages and, if you choose, every visit. Kept for 24 hours."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:149
msgid "Built-in country lookup"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:150
msgid "Finds the country of each visitor for the traffic map and country rules, using a free public domain database downloaded once a week (about 25 MB, no account). Nothing about your visitors leaves the site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:153
msgid "SIEM detections"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:154
msgid "Correlates the activity log in real time to spot attacks in progress, such as a login after brute force or risky changes from a new IP, and opens incidents you can work through on the SIEM tab."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:157
#: includes/views/tab-backups.php:33
msgid "Restore points"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:158
msgid "Saves a copy of a plugin or theme before it updates, of a file before it is repaired and of these settings before they change, so you can put them back from the Backups tab. Kept for 30 days."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:161
msgid "Block comment spam"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:162
msgid "Adds a hidden field and a signed time stamp to the comment form, refuses bots that fill it in or post within seconds, bans those that keep trying, and sends comments that skip the form to the spam folder. No CAPTCHA needed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:165
msgid "Approve new sign-ups"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:166
msgid "Accounts that visitors make for themselves cannot log in until an administrator approves them on the Users screen. You get an email for each one."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:169
msgid "Block posts without a user agent"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:170
msgid "Refuses form posts from visitors whose browser sends no user agent, which only scripts do. Block named bots and tools under Access."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:173
msgid "Close the REST API to visitors"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:174
msgid "Only logged-in users can use the REST API, apart from the routes you allow below. Embeds, WooCommerce checkout, Contact Form 7, WPForms and Jetpack stay open."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:177
msgid "Turn off RSS feeds"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:178
msgid "Feed addresses answer 410 Gone and the feed links leave your pages, so scrapers cannot copy posts from them. Leave on if you run a podcast or a newsletter from the feed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:181
msgid "Block image hotlinking"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:182
msgid "Stops other sites from showing your images and using your bandwidth. Search engines and the sites you allow below can still show them. Needs Apache or LiteSpeed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:185
